# North Star: SpecLang

The top-level intent. Everything references this.

## Project

```speclang
# @block:northstar/project @kind:note
SpecLang: A specification-driven programming language.

Specs are the source of truth. Humans write/review specs.
AI agents generate code. The filesystem is the event bus.
Code is like machine code - trusted, not hand-edited.

Core idea:
- Write specs in natural language + structured blocks
- Multi-agent system reacts to file changes
- Cascading updates until convergence
- Output: clean code in any language

Key innovations:
- inotify daemon tracks all changes
- Convergence detection triggers pipeline
- Self-defining build pipeline (build.yaml)
- Guard plugin enforces file ownership
- Self-healing recovery with rollback
```

## Getting Started

```speclang
# @block:northstar/getting-started @kind:note
For new agents and users:

1. **Read first:** `000-bootstrap.md` - Bootstrap primer and directory guide
2. **Then read:** This file (`project.scl`) - North Star intent
3. **Check:** `_index.md` in each directory - File listings
4. **Follow:** `@ref:` links in headers - Dependency chains

Key files to understand:
- `000-bootstrap.md` - READ FIRST - Explains everything
- `core.spec.md` - Core architecture
- `spec-format.spec.md` - Spec file format
- `headers.spec.md` - Universal headers

Remember: Specs are source code. Generated code is machine code.
```

## Goals

```speclang
# @block:northstar/goals @kind:entity
Goals:
  primary:
    - specs are what humans edit
    - generated code is disposable
    - AI understands intent, not just syntax
    
  secondary:
    - language agnostic output
    - bidirectional sync
    - concurrent agent execution
    - zero context loss via references
    
  new:
    - self-healing on failure
    - automatic pipeline execution
    - guard-rail for agent file access
```

## Architecture

```speclang
# @block:northstar/architecture @kind:diagram
```mermaid
flowchart TD
    U[User] -->|edits| NS[project.scl<br/>Level 0]
    NS -->|triggers| D[speclangd<br/>inotify + guard]
    D -->|routes| A[Agent Sessions]
    A -->|expands| S1[Level 1-9 Specs]
    S1 -->|maps| S2[Level 10 .go.spec]
    S2 -->|generates| G[generated/]
    G & S1 -->|triggers| D
    D -->|converged| P[Pipeline<br/>build.yaml]
    P -->|tests pass| C[Clean Code]
    P -->|fails| R[Recovery<br/>rollback]
    R --> NS
```
```

